{
  "about": "A door open on a port of Prowler 5.44.0's ec2_instance_port_* checks, a range that covers one, or every port (all, tcp/0-65535), in Argus's verdict: open when Reachable, open_ports when Restricted, network when Unknown; CloudFox's ports only where Argus has no verdict. Near misses: CloudFox's port 22 on a door Argus judged at 443, udp/22, icmp, a range missing every admin port, a ROUTES_TO from the internet no rule drew, a step inside the estate. A Restricted door counts what its groups open in either family on any interface (network): tcp/22 to ::/0 on an instance with no IPv6 address is one change from open.",
